{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13333","headline":"梅花落 · 刘方平","name":"梅花落","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新岁芳梅树，繁花四面同。\n春风吹渐落，一夜几枝空。\n少妇今如此，长城恨不穷。\n莫将辽海雪，来比後庭中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘方平","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13333.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13333","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"储仲君"}